---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../site.ts';
import { tools, conversions } from '../tools.ts';

// Home page heading for each tools.ts category.
const groups = { Convert: 'Converters', Sync: 'Syncing', 'Clean and validate': 'Fixing and cleaning', 'Create and edit': 'Create and edit', 'Merge and style': 'Merge and style', Lyrics: 'Lyrics' };
---

<Layout title={`${site.name}: free online subtitle tools (SRT, VTT, ASS)`} description="Free online subtitle tools: convert, sync, clean, merge and validate SRT, VTT, ASS, SAMI and SUB files, and make LRC lyrics. Files never leave your browser.">
  <h1>Free online subtitle tools</h1>
  <p class="lede">Convert, sync, clean, merge and validate subtitle files in your browser. No sign-up, no upload: your files stay on your device.</p>
  <nav class="popular" aria-label="Popular conversions">
    <h2>Popular conversions</h2>
    <ul>
      {conversions.map((t) => <li><a href={t.href}>{t.name}</a></li>)}
    </ul>
  </nav>
  <div class="tool-groups">
    {Object.entries(groups).map(([heading, category]) => (
      <section class="tool-group" aria-labelledby={`tools-${heading.toLowerCase().replaceAll(' ', '-')}`}>
        <h2 id={`tools-${heading.toLowerCase().replaceAll(' ', '-')}`}>{heading}</h2>
        <ul class="tools">
          {tools.filter((t) => t.category === category).map((t) => (
            <li>
              <a href={t.href}>{t.name}</a>
              <p>{t.blurb}</p>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </section>
    ))}
  </div>
  <section class="help">
    <h2>Which subtitle files work</h2>
    <p>Every tool reads SRT, WebVTT, ASS, SSA, SAMI, MicroDVD (.sub), MPL2 and LRC. The converters write SRT, WebVTT, ASS, plain text or PDF, and the <a href="/lrc-maker">LRC maker and editor</a> writes LRC lyrics. When a format has something the output can't hold, like ASS positions or karaoke timing, the tool lists what was dropped before you download.</p>
    <h2>Why files never leave your device</h2>
    <p>The tools run as code in your browser tab. Your subtitle file is read, changed and saved on your own computer, so there is no upload, no waiting on a server and no copy left behind. Subtitles for unreleased or private videos stay private.</p>
    <h2>Where to start</h2>
    <p>New to subtitle files? The <a href="/guides">guides</a> explain <a href="/guides/what-is-an-srt-file">what an SRT file is</a>, <a href="/guides/srt-vs-vtt">SRT vs VTT</a> and <a href="/guides/fix-out-of-sync-subtitles">how to fix out-of-sync subtitles</a>.</p>
    <p>Subtitles out of sync by the same amount the whole way through? Use the <a href="/subtitle-shifter">subtitle shifter</a>. Only one part drifts? Use the <a href="/partial-subtitle-shifter">partial shifter</a>. Strange characters like <code>Ã©</code> instead of <code>é</code> mean the file needs <a href="/utf-8-converter">converting to UTF-8</a> first. A player that refuses the file usually means a broken timestamp, which the <a href="/subtitle-validator">validator</a> finds.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .popular { margin-bottom: 64px; text-align: center; }
  .popular h2 { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: .286em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--graphite); margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .popular ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; }
  .popular a { display: inline-block; padding: 8px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--ink); border-radius: var(--pill); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: background-color .15s, scale .15s; }
  .popular a:hover { background: var(--cream); }
  .popular a:active { scale: .97; }
  .tool-groups { display: grid; gap: 64px; }
  .tool-group h2 { margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 500; }
  .tools { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 16px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr)); }
  .tools li { position: relative; background: var(--sun); border: 1px solid var(--ink); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 32px; }
  .tools li { transition: box-shadow .15s, scale .15s; }
  .tools li:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--ink); }
  .tools li:active { scale: .98; }
  .tools a { font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; }
  .tools a::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: inherit; }
  .tools p { margin: 8px 0 0; }
</style>
